Random-bond checks of the two general operator inequalities
  max ||h~ - pinch h~|| / ||h~|| over random bonds = 1.0604 (proved <= 2)
  max ||sum_alpha ad_alpha^2 h~|| / ||h~|| over random bonds = 2.1207 (proved <= 4; equals 2 x pinch ratio)
  explicit bond (J - 1) x 1 at d = 3: ratio = 1.3333 (= 4/3)

